Why It Is "Easier to Install and Ideal for Learning & Testing"
Zero Disruption to Your Daily System: You do not need a dedicated server or a wiped hard drive. You download an installer, click install, and run a virtual machine inside a desktop window while keeping your notes, browser, and music open.

Safe Sandbox for Practice: If you are testing malware or running risky Linux commands in the VM and break the system, you can instantly revert to a clean snapshot. Your host computer remains unaffected.

The Trade-Off (Overhead): Because the request must pass through the Host OS first, it runs noticeably slower than a bare-metal setup.

Industry Examples: Oracle VM VirtualBox, VMware Workstation Pro / Fusion, UTM, Parallels Desktop.
